 Violin Competition of Indianapolis\, and was also awarded 8 of the 11 spe
 cial prizes. Highlights of the 2024-25 season are concerto engagements wi
 th the Hartford\, Santa Fe and Southeast Missouri symphonies\, the Louisi
 ana Philharmonic\, and the Indianapolis Chamber Orchestra. Multiple recit
 als in the United States will culminate in her Carnegie Hall debut recita
