 many of the city's important halls\, including the Kennedy Center\, the N
 ational Gallery\, the Phillips Collection\, the Cosmos Club\, Strathmore 
 Hall\, and the French Embassy. Recent international engagements have take
 n him to Taiwan\, where he performed in five cities including Kaohsiung a
